  m_text: 'IN THE SPIRE

    Rise. Fight. Conquer the Spire.


    DEVELOPED BY

    Hallowed
    Anvil Labs


    PROGRAMMING

    Ahmed Al-Hasham


    CONCEPT & STORY DESIGN

    Alexis
    Gabriel Morales


    TESTING

    Adrian Hociota


    CHARACTER ART & ANIMATION

    Vaelor
    - Hero Knight pixel art pack

    Calderus - Fantasy Creatures Pixel Art Pack

    Enemies
    - Monsters Creatures Fantasy 1 & 2

    Unity Asset Store


    ENVIRONMENT ART

    The
    Forest - Woods Tileset & Background by karsiori

    The Caves - Pixel Fantasy
    Caves


    MAIN MENU ART & LOGO

    Volcanic Spire Background and In The Spire
    Logo

    Created with OpenAI image-generation tools


    MUSIC

    Valley
    of Dreams - The Forest

    Tomorrow the Battle Will Be Long - The Caves

    Good
    Day To Die - The Spire

    Non-copyrighted music, sourced from YouTube


    SOUND
    EFFECTS

    Created for In The Spire by Hallowed Anvil Labs


    SPECIAL THANKS

    Centennial
    College

    Our instructors, classmates, friends and playtesters


    All third-party
    assets remain the property

    of their respective creators.


    Copyright
    2026 Hallowed Anvil Labs'
