  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<size=40><color=#FFD36A>A FALLEN KINGDOM</color></size>


    A fallen
    kingdom. A guilty knight.

    One final climb to end Calderus''s reign.


    Vaelor
    must fight through the ruins, face his past,

    and reach the top of the Spire.

    The
    kingdom has fallen, but Vaelor''s journey is only beginning.

    To save what
    remains, Vaelor must defeat Calderus

    and reclaim the Spire.


    From guilt
    and destruction rises one final chance for redemption.



    <size=40><color=#FFD36A>VAELOR</color></size>


    Vaelor
    is a skilled warrior determined to reclaim his fallen kingdom.

    He fights
    with his sword, his speed and his combat skill.

    He carries the guilt of
    failing to protect his home.

    His journey is one of revenge, redemption,

    and
    the defeat of Calderus.

    His final goal is to reach the top of the Spire

    and
    save what remains of his kingdom.



    <size=40><color=#FFD36A>CALDERUS</color></size>


    Calderus
    is a powerful fire creature

    who destroyed Vaelor''s kingdom.

    He now
    rules from the top of the Spire.

    He commands devastating fire attacks

    and
    crushing blows up close.

    He is Vaelor''s greatest challenge.

    Defeating
    Calderus ends his reign

    and completes Vaelor''s journey.



    <size=40><color=#FFD36A>THE
    JOURNEY</color></size>


    The Forest  -  The Caves  -  The Spire


    Rise.
    Fight. Conquer the Spire.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
